Z||000000||Oreif||04-01-2001||10:37 PM||||OK At present I am sending emblems out to:<BR>DL10 (GT style)<BR>Flyntus (GT style)<BR>and<BR>sqoach. (all white + below)<P>At present I have 3 more blank sets.<BR>DXR_DAD, I have a set where the back clips are cracked, will these do for your display?<P>Also many folks have asked about horn buttons. Well sqoach sent me one and it appears I can only do white. When adding colors to the epoxy, the epoxy gets brittle and depressing it slightly was causing cracks. With just using the straight white I get no cracks. It takes about 3 times as long to do since I can't wetsand the edges. I have to use a small scalpel and very carefully scrape the edges. I have not derived a cost to do them yet. I am waiting to see the response I get from the pic below.<BR>(The more people who want them the less the cost will be.) The one below is being sent to sqoach.<P>Now I know your all dying to see how the horn turned out.............<P><BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Horn.jpg"> <BR><P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/LOGO3.jpg"> ||||reg||6
