Z||000007||Oreif||04-02-2001||07:23 PM||||The epoxy paint I use works fine. It's just to color it I use a colored hardner and it gets too brittle with the extra hardner in it. So white isn't a problem. The silicone will peel over time due to the properties of the soft vinyl. The epoxy won't.||||reg||1
